{"availability":"available","full":"context-machine-lab/ContextAgent","name":"ContextAgent","description":"Context-central multi-agent framework with PyTorch-like API. Build intelligent agent systems with minimal code.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":77,"forks":7,"created":"2025-10-01T22:56:56Z","updated":"2025-10-26T15:21:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://context-machine-lab.github.io/ContextAgent/","topics":["ai-agents","autonomous-agents","context-engineering","llm","machine-learning","multi-agent-systems","openai","python","pytorch-like","research"],"demo":"https://context-machine-lab.github.io/ContextAgent/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.909Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.909Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.909Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.909Z","stars":77,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ContextAgent is a lightweight, context-central multi-agent systems framework designed for easy context engineering. It focuses on efficiently managing the context of each agent and binds all agents through simplified, centralized context operations. Unlike traditional multi-agent frameworks, ContextAgent treats agents simply as LLMs with different contexts, eliminating unnecessary complexity. Built with a PyTorch-like API, developers can create sophisticated multi-agent systems with minimal code."],"features":["📋 Context = Template + State: Dynamic context management based on Anthropic's blog.","🔀 Decoupled Agent Design: Agent = LLM + Context. All agents are just LLMs with different contexts.","🎨 PyTorch-Like Pipeline API: Inherit BasePipeline, define async run(), use @autotracing for tracing.","🌐 Multi-LLM Support: Works with OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, and more.","🧩 Modular Architecture: Built on OpenAI Agents SDK with clear separation: context, agents, pipeline."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/con